<Item XName="CouplingMatrix" Type="PartParam">
<DataEntry>couplingMtx</DataEntry>
<Description>Mutual coupling matrix of the antenna array. Matrix size should be N-by-N, where N is the number of antennas. CouplingMatrix(m,n) represents the complex coupling coefficient from the m-th antenna element to the n-th antenna element.</Description>
<DocSymbol />
<Range />
<RunTimeTunable><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></RunTimeTunable>
<Validate><T>Int</T><D>15</D></Validate></Item></Item></Item></Item>
